Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:23:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Rename GreenSearch to Arboris across package, CLI, env
 and site (0.9.0)

Decision D3. The package, command, distribution, env vars and
localStorage keys are now arboris / ARBORIS_*. For one release the old
names keep working: a greensearch shim package, the greensearch command,
GREENSEARCH_* env fallbacks logged at startup, and a one-time migration
of saved chats in the browser. The Cloud Run runbook explains moving
the existing greensearch service.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QwFoL83RLwMbjVMnWRkYs7
